Meeting type: {{ $('Normalize Complete Notes').item.json.meetingType }}
Meeting date: {{ $('Normalize Complete Notes').item.json.meetingDate }}
Doc: {{ $('Normalize Complete Notes').item.json.docUrl }}
Notes:
{{ $('Normalize Complete Notes').item.json.meetingText }}

Return {"items":[{"itemId":"string","rawText":"string","sourceExcerpt":"string","owner":null,"componentHints":["string"],"classification":"repo-work|design-work|process/meta|decision-record|already-tracked","reason":"string","duplicateCandidates":[],"createEligible":false}],"completeness":{"extracted":0,"classified":0}}

Rules:
- The Google Doc is the sole notes source.
- Classify every candidate item; do not omit process or meta items.
- process/meta includes prioritizing, assigning, estimating, creating tickets, and spreadsheet itemization; never create an issue.
- decision-record and already-tracked items do not create new issues.
- repo-work and design-work are candidates for human review only.
- Do not invent component capabilities or product decisions.

